<Slide style={{ width: '1280px', height: '720px', background: '#0A1626' }}>
  <Box style={{ height: 120, padding: '24px 64px', borderBottom: '1px solid #1E3A5F' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 500, color: '#E8F0FA' }}>第 8 章 · 遥控 main() 与初始化</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#9DB4CE', marginTop: 6 }}>文件：遥控程序/Remoter_Ctrl3.6/ANO_Remoter/main.c · 第 22 行</Text>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ height: 540, padding: '20px 64px', flexDirection: 'row', gap: 40 }}>
    <Box style={{ width: '58%', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 9, justifyContent: 'center' }}>
      {[['RCC_Configuration()','开时钟 USART1/SPI1/ADC1/TIM3/USART3/I2C1'],
        ['NVIC_PriorityGroupConfig(4)','4 位抢占优先级'],
        ['ANO_LED_Init()','LED + 蜂鸣器'],
        ['ANO_Param_READ()','从 Flash 读参数'],
        ['USB_HID_Init()','接匿名上位机(地面站)'],
        ['ANO_SPI_Init() → NRF_Check → NRF_Init','设为主发送 MODEL_TX2'],
        ['ADC1_Init() / KEY_Init() / OLED_Init()','采样/按键/屏幕'],
        ['SysTick_Config(CoreClock/500)','2ms 中断'],
        ['while(1) if(oled_delay) Show_Duty()','主循环只刷屏！']].map((d,i)=>(
        <Box key={i} style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', background: i===8? '#1E3A5F':'#0F1E33', padding: '10px 16px', borderRadius: 7, borderLeft: i===8? '4px solid #00D1FF':'4px solid #4A90D9' }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: i===8? '#00D1FF':'#E8F0FA', fontFamily: 'monospace', fontWeight: i===8?700:500, flex: 1 }}>{d[0]}</Text>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#9DB4CE', width: 230 }}>{d[1]}</Text>
        </Box>
      ))}
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ width: '38%', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 16, justifyContent: 'center' }}>
      <Box style={{ background: '#0F1E33', borderLeft: '4px solid #00D1FF', padding: '16px 22px', borderRadius: 8 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#E8F0FA', lineHeight: 1.55 }}>
          与飞控关键差异：遥控的<span style={{ color: '#00D1FF', fontWeight: 700 }}>真正逻辑不在 while(1)</span>，而在 SysTick 中断触发的 <span style={{ color:'#00D1FF', fontFamily:'monospace' }}>ANO_Loop</span> 调度器里（代码连写三遍注释"全部运行程序在 ANO_Scheduler.c"）。
        </Text>
      </Box>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#9DB4CE', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
        讲清这点，听众才不会被"空荡荡的 while"误导。
      </Text>
    </Box>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ height: 60, padding: '0 64px', flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#7E94AE' }}>飞控+遥控 代码讲解（30min）</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#7E94AE' }}>13 / 22</Text>
  </Box>
</Slide>
